<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KCSE Transition Hub | Results, KUCCPS, SSP & HELB Guide</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #006633;
            --dark: #1a1a1a;
            --light: #f4f7f6;
            --accent: #d9232e;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--light);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #004d26);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.8rem; }
        header p { margin: 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 1rem; }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }
        /* Paywall Box */
        #paywall-box {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-top: 5px solid var(--accent);
        }
        .price-tag {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .features-list {
            text-align: left;
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .features-list li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        
        /* M-Pesa Payment Box */
        .mpesa-box {
            background: #e6f4ea;
            border: 2px dashed var(--primary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }
        .phone-display {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .copy-btn {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .copy-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

        .verify-section {
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .verify-section input {
            padding: 12px;
            width: 60%;
            max-width: 220px;
            border: 2px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .unlock-btn {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .unlock-btn:hover { background-color: #004d26; }

        /* Protected Content (Hidden until paid) */
        #premium-guide {
            display: none;
        }
        .guide-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
        }
        .guide-card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e6f4ea;
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>KCSE University & College Transition Guide</h1>
    <p>Step-by-step instructions for Results, KUCCPS Placement, SSP & HELB Funding</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- PAYMENT PROMPT SECTION -->
    <div id="paywall-box">
        <span class="badge">INSTANT ACCESS</span>
        <h2>Unlock the Complete Student Application Guide</h2>
        <p>Get clear, accurate instructions to avoid costly application mistakes.</p>
        <div class="price-tag">KES 100</div>
        
        <ul class="features-list">
            <li><strong>1. KCSE Results:</strong> Official KNEC portal checking steps.</li>
            <li><strong>2. KUCCPS Portal:</strong> How to check cluster weights & select courses.</li>
            <li><strong>3. SSP (Self-Sponsored):</strong> How to apply directly to universities.</li>
            <li><strong>4. HELB & HEF Portal:</strong> First-time loan & scholarship checklist.</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- DIRECT M-PESA PAYMENT INSTRUCTIONS -->
        <div class="mpesa-box">
            <div><strong>Step 1:</strong> Go to M-Pesa &rarr; <strong>Send Money</strong></div>
            <div class="phone-display" id="mpesa-number">0118389527</div>
            <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyNumber()">Copy Phone Number</button>
            <div style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Amount: <strong>KES 100</strong></div>
        </div>

        <!-- M-PESA CODE UNLOCK -->
        <div class="verify-section">
            <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Enter the 10-character M-Pesa Transaction Code from your SMS to unlock:</p>
            <input type="text" id="mpesa-code" placeholder="e.g. SLK89X21MP" maxlength="10">
            <button class="unlock-btn" onclick="verifyManualCode()">Unlock Guide</button>
            <p id="error-msg" style="color: red; display: none; margin-top: 8px; font-weight: bold;"></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PROTECTED GUIDE SECTION -->
    <div id="premium-guide">
        <div style="background: #d4edda; color: #155724; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">
            <strong>Payment Confirmed!</strong> Bookmark this page or take screenshots for reference.
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 1: KCSE RESULTS -->
        <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="badge">STEP 1</span>
            <h2>How to Check KCSE Results</h2>
            <p>KNEC uses the official online portal for provisional results:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Visit the official KNEC results portal: <strong>results.knec.ac.ke</strong></li>
                <li>Enter your <strong>11-digit KCSE Index Number</strong> (without spaces or slashes).</li>
                <li>Enter your <strong>registered name</strong> (at least one name as it appears on your registration slip).</li>
                <li>Click <strong>Submit / View Results</strong> to display your provisional slip.</li>
                <li><em>Tip:</em> Always collect your official printed result slip from your former high school for university registration.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 2: KUCCPS APPLICATION -->
        <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="badge">STEP 2</span>
            <h2>How to Apply for Schools via KUCCPS</h2>
            <p>Once KUCCPS opens the student portal (usually between March and April):</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Go to <strong>students.kuccps.net</strong> and click <strong>Login</strong>.</li>
                <li>Use your <strong>KCSE Index Number</strong>, <strong>KCSE Year</strong>, and your <strong>KCPE Index Number</strong> (or Birth Certificate Number) as the initial password.</li>
                <li>Check your <strong>Cluster Weights</strong> under the "Programmes" tab. Compare your points against the previous year's cut-off points.</li>
                <li>Select <strong>4 Degree Choices</strong> (1a, 1b, 1c, 2, 3, 4) or Diploma/Certificate courses depending on your mean grade (C+ and above for Degree; C- and above for Diploma).</li>
                <li>Pay the <strong>KES 1,500</strong> KUCCPS application fee via the M-Pesa eCitizen prompt generated on the portal and submit before the deadline.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 3: SSP APPLICATION -->
        <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="badge">STEP 3</span>
            <h2>How to Apply via SSP (Self-Sponsored Programme)</h2>
            <p>If you miss your preferred course through KUCCPS or want to join immediately as a parallel/self-sponsored student:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Visit the specific university's official admissions portal (e.g., <em>application.uonbi.ac.ke</em>, <em>ku.ac.ke</em>, <em>jkuat.ac.ke</em>, <em>mku.ac.ke</em>).</li>
                <li>Create an applicant account and select <strong>Self-Sponsored / Module II / Privately Sponsored</strong> intake (usually May or September).</li>
                <li>Upload scanned PDF copies of your <strong>KCSE Result Slip, KCPE Certificate, National ID/Birth Certificate, and Passport Photo</strong>.</li>
                <li>Pay the university's non-refundable application fee (typically KES 1,000 – KES 2,000) via their official bank/M-Pesa paybill.</li>
                <li>Download your admission letter once approved. Note that SSP students can still apply for HELB loans.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 4: HELB & HEF APPLICATION -->
        <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="badge">STEP 4</span>
            <h2>How to Apply for HELB Loan & Government Scholarship (HEF)</h2>
            <p>Under the Student-Centred Funding Model, both scholarships and loans are applied for on one portal:</p>
            <ol>
